{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object. Take it if light, move and do task. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = isObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
